{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n \n くみちゃんお誕生日おめでとう🎊🎉\n \n \n 1月22日はくみちゃんのお誕生日です！\n \n \n 22歳おめでとう🎈🎈\n \n \n 数ヶ月間\n ひらがなで1人だけ22歳だったから\n くみちゃんが誕生日を迎えてくれて嬉しい〜\n \n \n 同い年なのに私より何倍もしっかりしていて\n ひらがなけやきをまとめてくれて\n 引っ張ってくれるくみちゃんに\n いつも感謝してます！\n \n 頼りない同い年だけど\n これからもよろしくね☺️☺️\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHB9BNKQ8SJEK5MJ2PJC3DZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHB9CKEZ3PYZNHQVWFMCHNV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHB9DMMJCK0JCAFP3RZEWS4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n たまごポーロを食べる22歳✌️✌️\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHB9EN1KNXDRB1G44EEJ247","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHB9FMH900ZCZK6FM16WQTY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n くみちゃんの隣には\n いつもしほちゃんがいます☺️☺️\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHB9GHFBK7BVKEJ9KZN7RXZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHB9HGSP81KHCA2S776247G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHB9JFRVXP9NC22P2YHK0DZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n めいめいの手✌️\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHB9KQ33009VBWMBRG59W2C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n そしてその周りには\n メンバーがわちゎわちゃしてて\n くみちゃんの周りはいつも明るいです！\n \n ひらがなけやきのムードメーカーです！\n \n \n \n 一緒に楽しい22歳過ごそうね！\n \n \n \n 誕生日おめでとう🎂🎁"}],"source":"archive"}